{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "16dd030dbdd7cdb1913ab4244ad1514d8accf625217c888d314dfdfe644fd6ab", "ja": "麗花のお家へようこそ！", "zh": "欢迎光临丽花家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e084d7ea82c5297420834dfa1c8297ad56fcd15783df8399b8f8bb0251c7c1d", "ja": "ルームシェア初日、風花からの助けを請う\n電話に、慌てて麗花の家へと駆けつける\nプロデューサー。と、そこは、大掃除の\n真っ最中だった。掃除の後、4人から\nそれぞれの手料理を振る舞われる。", "zh": "共居首日，制作人接到风花的求救电话，\n慌忙赶到丽花家。\n然而，眼前所见却是正在大扫除的众人。\n结束清扫之后，四人亲自下厨，\n各自端出拿手好菜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6bf290421d5a7daf7e80109f9c27480e6d327865f9ade1280ebb4fb6c29530e", "ja": "（今日から4人のルームシェア生活が始まる！\n念のため、様子を見に行くことにしたのだが……）", "zh": "（四人的共居生活就从今天开始！\n保险起见，我决定去看看情况。然而……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1001_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1905c6e7d31c8d5e4de061f17d0198cd09798c87fc76c6b5966a5ba78becd110", "ja": "うん？　風花から電話だ。……もしもし、風花？\nちょうど良かった、もうすぐ着くところ……。", "zh": "嗯？是风花打来的电话……喂，风花？\n你打来得正好，我马上就要到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0dcc5affeb77475809c65b778f28b16ef43626ca8215e4480e9e59ce5b562cf5", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお願いです、助けてくれませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n拜托你，可以来救救我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1bbe408d4dd8ec91973b747b3fe7e8f4f2046a0056194eaaad07658c00ed771a", "ja": "助けてって……どうかしたのか！？", "zh": "什么叫救救你们……发生什么事了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f6764aacacccde1e091856b9d1c58b82b4d1e217f027b3448b40eea75b870f1e", "ja": "それが、麗花ちゃんの家で……。\n……きゃあっ！？", "zh": "其实我们在丽花家……\n……哇啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8766f02a51a21bc430470706d7c2bb548bd414d76e20c59e4b75a02c2c77f5a8", "ja": "どうした、風花！　風花っ！？\n……電話が切れた。一体、何が……。", "zh": "怎么了，风花！风花！？\n……电话挂断了，到底发生什么事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c43f83ce696f900eb06f9f0e40b781e66a347e4738e10d97decea68f04014056", "ja": "と、とにかく、先を急ごう！\nもしもの時は、俺がみんなを守らないと……！", "zh": "总、总之，我最好快点过去！\n要是有个万一，我得保护大家才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0c296702c4ebc8ed4aa9a538fe625dd27539d97140453a67037227d2bc8d064a", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ。\n麗花の家は確か……、あそこだ！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼，\n我记得丽花家在……就是那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1009_se", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "494c9c32a37016a8edaf110bdd68328040a9b4f6aa06a7134a587b10360db317", "ja": "大丈夫か、風花、みんな！\n……って、ものすごく荒らされている！？", "zh": "风花、各位，你们没事吧！\n……哇，屋里被翻得乱七八糟！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "65d60e49d3bb8cfc1a468a64b701e53e3ce4fc5b66232fcba503b29ef3bb8898", "ja": "ふう。燃えないゴミを入れる袋は、\nどれでしたっけ……？", "zh": "呼，丢不可燃垃圾的袋子，\n是哪一个才对……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "bb6816817bec68f03817308e08a59053723420b21d4fb13272a315e0814d302a", "ja": "ああ、それならこっちよ。\n片付けても片付けても、終わりが見えないわね……。", "zh": "哦，那个要丢到这边。\n再怎么打扫，好像都打扫不完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "174269a6480f3e62043ecdef54fa07cf73e02cd52709c2b61af1ba3d7c35fddd", "ja": "フレーフレーみんなー♪　どんどんぱふぱふー♪\n応援するのって、やっぱり気持ちがいいですねっ♪", "zh": "加油加油，大家加油──♪咚咚叭噗叭噗──♪\n帮别人加油实在很愉快呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dbd009e3fe2200a157b1eea26b9e0b2811aed3681308e6f53fbe0d7f16869e29", "ja": "こ、これは一体……？", "zh": "这、这到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "401169c0ca1fb0fd34f2ed95805aeac3b4b8610a32e947d24302e94b74d287c0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\n来てくれたんですね、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你过来了呀，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4d7e381c6138e6acba0dd77c5423110164a6d8c89eb87c348c5b5e09a7dd338e", "ja": "風花！　みんな大丈夫……みたいだな。\nさっきの電話はなんだったんだ……？", "zh": "风花！你们大家……好像都平安无事。\n刚才那通电话是怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "824000d784abd8a6e9b9f6dccefd8f0f5a379cdec44a086a48cb6aacf38b1b1f", "ja": "えっと、麗花ちゃんの部屋が、4人で住むにはちょっと\n散らかってるから、大掃除をすることになったんです。", "zh": "呃，因为丽花的房间要住四个人的话，有点太乱了，\n所以我们决定来大扫除。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "16981120de7c106e9eb3f4b64cad54dfd751560ddd35b95742c932373634da16", "ja": "ちょっと散らかって……そ、そうか。\n荒らされてはいなかったんだな……。", "zh": "你说有点太乱……这、这样啊。\n原来不是因为被人翻箱倒柜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "83cac0ddf3f9d62d1a4484f3aa6e97baa48601687aabb6d886046311e9ddb1a4", "ja": "けど、私達だけじゃ今日中に片付け終わらなさそうで。\n手伝ってもらえないかなと思って電話したんです。", "zh": "但是，光靠我们几个好像没办法在今天内打扫完，\n所以我才打电话给你，想问你能不能帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7c4830aa39742e5e091f6ec809a033cd8ee38cf0c8a8f8a547d1ef5fa0edc4f5", "ja": "なるほど。だけど、どうして急に\n電話を切ったりしたんだ？　心配したぞ。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，你为什么突然挂断电话？\n害我刚才好担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c59a655cdfef968fae18ade660da82eb9589aab892d9640f581f55b7c29a0fb", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい！　実は電話中に、床に脱ぎ捨て\nられていた麗花ちゃんの服を踏んで、滑っちゃって。", "zh": "啊，对不起！其实是我在讲电话的时候，\n踩到丽花换下来后就丢在地上的衣服，摔了一跤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d503b4a8b78b0ed8861d1a8c493994cccc992aa3a701ffdeac55aed82d58426c", "ja": "それでスマホを落として、切れちゃったんです。\nでも……心配してくれて、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "结果手机掉到地上，不小心挂断电话了。\n不过……谢谢你担心我们♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "94d1238dccacb45c2a4416690e7b8cab7c5806ebe16de2c6be4c1050027e88da", "ja": "いや、まあ……\nとにかくみんなが無事なら、良かったよ。", "zh": "哪里，这没什么……\n总之，大家都平安无事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6bc9fbfa9eb52b1d8c17629af4ab67f559b6ec33724d106603b3fb2574e66305", "ja": "それじゃ、俺は大掃除を手伝えばいいんだな？\n力仕事なら任せておいてくれ！", "zh": "那么，要我帮忙大扫除就对了吧？\n需要力气的工作就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "989e55c5500669247855fe72f49f8a814e583a4e87812ca4be6b56caa5b0db5b", "ja": "お掃除デューサーさん、よろしくお願いします♪\nちなみに私は応援係です！　えっへん♪", "zh": "扫除制作人先生，麻烦你了♪\n顺便一提，我负责帮大家加油！哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9e4ced62d3281ea21961404bd59dae5120dd931b99c8d4308a946c208ec1b845", "ja": "はは、応援ありがとう、麗花。ついでに捨てていい\nものとダメなもの、指示してくれると助かるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你的加油，丽花。\n如果你能顺便帮忙指出能丢跟不能丢的东西就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3f645f6279faff0bea9a4b8be4ec00e2542baf8b7bfb9e0187b9ba320e2eec96", "ja": "あっ、これって……。", "zh": "啊，这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e756711a683c655a74289b0a0b572a45861bed7f5fc676875040f4424b490836", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、風花……。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "34bd1d54613407307d011fbc2a51c397a5a41e64473683687c8886d97fde281a", "ja": "み、見ちゃダメです{$P$}さん！\n女の子の部屋には、秘密がいっぱいなんですから！", "zh": "你、你不能看啦，{$P$}先生！\n女孩子的房间里可是充满了秘密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "63304e049370df1a4fd5f8ae4c8381d6cb43cc50317da45010bdfe1e90a79755", "ja": "あっ、そうですね！\nこれはちょっと、見せられませんね？　えへへ。", "zh": "啊，说得也是呢！\n这的确不太能让他看见，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "15ed1b4e5a9271594b2c334ec170f17eb0b24a1cfe7112a946f15efa347fef3e", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん？\nお呼びするまで、外にいてもらった方が……。", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}先生。\n在我们喊你进来前，还是请你先待在外面比较……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "1ec29c0373e5d7eb2bd135c48b9a1396357393e769f147a56905a9142693ad89", "ja": "わ、わかりました……。\nそれじゃ、ちょっと出ていますね。", "zh": "我、我知道了……\n那我先出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8fc34d7284cb2192d2f7ce207a7e310be590909130876882558bc12cb08fc0df", "ja": "（呼ばれたばかりですが……）", "zh": "（我不是才刚被叫过来吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1034_null", "source_sha256": "ff6cc24d5bf03e533d6b778f6184ca1d9b0fa58a56e931b8422f6fccfb8f49cb", "ja": "そして、数時間後……", "zh": "接着，几小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "c8733c8563a28a36f5fe1d3bfd7d2dfd6f928389c80aaa6a10d0b28e35e4ca8c", "ja": "わぁっ、ピッカピカですね♪\nこんなに綺麗なお部屋、お引っ越しの時以来かもです！", "zh": "哇，房间整个亮晶晶♪\n这么干净的房间，好像从我搬进来后就没见过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "4af3d356a829c64cd4179fd0144b0a3a82bfb71a14db6b8ee037aa65122fb3b7", "ja": "お掃除お疲れさま！　それじゃあ、晩ご飯の\n用意をしましょうか。材料は用意してあるわ。", "zh": "大家打扫辛苦了！\n那我们来煮晚餐吧，我已经准备好食材了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "d2df7fbec739c9f2ceab8e06d5c228ed013bb9fd73256d2339504b26d44ee82f", "ja": "今日の献立はカレー！　それから一人一品、料理を\n作るの。{$P$}も食べてくでしょ？", "zh": "今天的菜单是咖哩！然后每个人再做一道菜。\n{$P$}也会吃完晚餐再走吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "99534871fe74dca60f40a18ecc3649a924ce776ee7eef408f184c4518c977e13", "ja": "いいんですか？　それじゃ、ごちそうになろうかな。\nみんなの料理、楽しみです！", "zh": "可以吗？那我就留下来用饭吧。\n我很期待大家的料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "7c13f553007449c7752d1d75c2a5be4bf7126a07552189617c58bdca38612643", "ja": "カレーなら、このみお姉さんに任せなさい♪\nまずは玉ねぎから。さあ、ザクザク切るわよ！", "zh": "咖哩就放心交给木实姊姊吧♪\n首先处理洋葱，看我切得碎碎的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "15ebef10aeb196998263006dd3daebdbe7b89053f271ee01d13a5969078c9ede", "ja": "私は鯛のカルパッチョを作ろうと思います。\n白ワインや日本酒に、よく合うんですって♪", "zh": "我想做薄切生鲷鱼片，\n听说跟白酒、日本酒都很搭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7a6217d2bff81dcc30f2d3fde33a2433df217a51bfd114918763f9ec36a2ef5", "ja": "私は、具だくさんの茶わん蒸しにしますね。\nトロトロにして、お出汁もたっぷり効かせて♪", "zh": "我要做料多多茶碗蒸。\n要蒸得滑嫩，还要加入满满的高汤♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "b46b771a18ecf4c474f5c7fbcb50081bee9b7c3e305cc5b0fbf64ad3a6d7ee11", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ私は、冷蔵庫の余り物を\nぽぽいぽーいって炒めよっと♪　シェフ北上です！", "zh": "那么那么，我就把冰箱里剩下的东西，\n咻咻咻丢进锅里炒一炒吧♪我是大厨北上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "a2f6c23425189fd2c438474f5a891a7d379dab2725a4a29c521de69284c569de", "ja": "レモンに梅干し、黒酢にブロッコリーと納豆！\nそれからそれから……♪", "zh": "柠檬、梅干、黑醋、花椰菜跟纳豆！\n还有还有……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ddd64b60788241aa4ad182b76fa6da0d6ca006438b3f3233da75a2ebfe75899b", "ja": "麗花、いろいろな意味で……\nほどほどに頼む！", "zh": "丽花，从各方面来说……\n拜托你适可而止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "db363c89ae6500ec6244d5a6ab20659301833a4a41baf16a7e0d30a37f9455d1", "ja": "（その後……このみさんの涙が止まらなかったり、\n麗花がフランベを始めたりとトラブルもあったが……）", "zh": "（之后……虽然发生了木实泪流不止，\n丽花浇酒让锅子烧起来等状况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "13300810d931c1f2d7b8fcb61fbf0da07fcd62cfb011f17e3c5b458d79163ec0", "ja": "（無事に4人の手料理が完成した！）", "zh": "（她们四人还是顺利亲手完成料理！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "b1f094d2a0fd78249f475e6ea9d5f3cf0e903eaa848099057c0344fb579ded22", "ja": "それじゃあ、これからクランクインまでの共同生活、\nよろしくお願いします♪　乾杯！", "zh": "那么，接下来直到开镜前的共居生活，\n就请你们多多指教了♪干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1049_048rei", "source_sha256": "2c52782f8676c6ac728db1d0fadfbe42c2748e8982e5c77a3c80f7e27a1f31c9", "ja": "かんぱーい♪", "zh": "干杯～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1050_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45c74d22a2f8a48d0c3749a5eb0c4bd08d13b68da1c30d799fac138fc57fb2cf", "ja": "乾杯♪", "zh": "干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "e8cd3035e055196c7deb17907a16a6b63e1484e4fa29a8a36b2d9311a28bb414", "ja": "このカレー、スパイスが程よく効いてて、\nおいしいですね！　さすがこのみさん！", "zh": "这道咖哩的香料味恰到好处，\n非常好吃！不愧是木实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1052_039kon", "source_sha256": "0f9cce24480e8d86e1b8c8a5df0263ce1ca4a162f13573c97ff1af28f20a4efa", "ja": "ふふっ、そうでしょ♪　大人の味、\nたっぷり楽しんでちょうだい！", "zh": "呵呵，对吧♪\n尽情享用大人的味道吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0aaeb068297e7b22d0a8e060a2c759754070dbc8542748d4f4edad71858cc280", "ja": "歌織さんの作ったカルパッチョも……まるで、\n高級レストランの料理みたいな、上品な味です！", "zh": "歌织小姐做的薄切生鱼片也是……\n味道高雅，堪比高级餐厅的料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1054_052kao", "source_sha256": "5283703926232dd109958594eba1290dd3958810b893ccc09c63d2d49cf45709", "ja": "あっ、知人に教わったソースのおかげですね。\n……お口に合ったみたいで、よかったです♪", "zh": "啊，这要归功于朋友教我的酱汁。\n……看来很合你的胃口，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "263550b87630f672410f5ada8c9b230188c4607721c20b990e14261004008213", "ja": "風花の茶わん蒸しは、\n家庭的でほっこりする味だな。うまいよ！", "zh": "风花的茶碗蒸很家常，\n吃起来有种温馨的感觉，真是好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1056_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e07b91b0c8f591f4f149ee31be6a33854e236acee9c66d55e40179643a10c1f", "ja": "ふふっ、おかわりもありますから、\nどんどん食べてくださいね♪", "zh": "呵呵，吃不够还有很多，\n请尽量吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1057_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bb4735a782e9ac81525ebb37da70e0df44ca1fc3892235b7966304dfc367cd47", "ja": "それにしても、みんなの料理、本当においしい！\nついついお酒が進んじゃいます……♪", "zh": "话说回来，大家做的菜都很美味呢！\n让我忍不住一直配酒……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1058_p", "source_sha256": "0e428a53cebff7a39f50d35178f964d9dd06b9d948f184626df19a1114aee48c", "ja": "麗花の作った謎の料理も……。意外なことに、\nおいしいな。どうなってるんだ、これ……。", "zh": "连丽花做的神秘料理……没想到也很好吃。\n这到底怎么回事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1059_048rei", "source_sha256": "bb85e481f758ff37ce623b6abcfcb3fc63ddccdf744162169101004e6726b26f", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nやっぱり料理は火力が大事なんですね！", "zh": "谢谢夸奖♪\n料理最重要的果然还是火候呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1060_048rei", "source_sha256": "21fb3ae13c1414051f190b4c83e21451640a55301e98561957c37971f740686d", "ja": "それで、誰の料理が一番おいしいですか、\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生，\n谁的料理最好吃呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1061_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "6f9106e47db2d97971d365d2519b840b5040ddc994fff8238dfc103cd997420b", "ja": "いい質問ね、麗花ちゃん！\nこの際だから、はっきりさせてもらいましょう♪", "zh": "问得好，丽花！\n趁这个机会让他说清楚吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1063_p", "source_sha256": "80dd7342182207e6590d02a064cb7ae99f7212cfee300dcc9a48d62c9b7a40c4", "ja": "なにをですか！？\nいや本当に、味は甲乙つけがたいというか……。", "zh": "说清楚什么！？\n别这样啦，这些菜的味道真的很难分高下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1064_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aeced64fcb00636e0980c93cc7ecadce0bdd7ca9e2261b2e3990194c93bedcad", "ja": "も～っ、{$P$}しゃん！\nごまかしゃないでくらしゃい！！", "zh": "真速的～{$P$}先生！\n请你鼻要打哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1065_p", "source_sha256": "160dbc97ea424e8045fbb2d572a37a4365dbf4ff8a79adecac053654d7e984cd", "ja": "いつの間に酔ったんだ風花！？\nていうか早すぎないか！？", "zh": "你什么时候喝醉了，风花！？\n是说也太快了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1066_052kao", "source_sha256": "b41b1b952ab2103992306babd528d85fb404ae079494c3e341a4d4983247b1c6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お水です！\nこれを風花ちゃんに……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，水在这边！\n请递给风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_02_1067_p", "source_sha256": "4ef190175744827341e356dd956074ba225c169ef0e05c4829788906c5d4a489", "ja": "助かります！　ほら風花、水も飲んで。\n急にたくさん飲み過ぎるのは、良くないぞ。", "zh": "谢谢！好了，风花，喝点水吧。\n一下子喝太多酒可不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
